  "bodyHash": "b69b6a6e55077fca",
  "content": "<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>动态难度</strong></h1>\n<h5 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flunapixel.studio%252fdiscord\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Discord-gray?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&labelColor=222222&color=888888\" width=\"159\" height=\"38\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp; </strong><a href=\"https://github.com/muon-rw/Dynamic-Difficulty\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/github-gray?style=for-the-badge&logo=github&labelColor=222222&color=888888\" width=\"146\" height=\"38\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/muonr/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/curseforge-gray?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&labelColor=222222&color=888888\" width=\"194\" height=\"38\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fmuon-rw\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/modrinth-gray?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&labelColor=222222&color=888888\" width=\"175\" height=\"38\"></a></h5>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><br>动态难度</strong> 是一个高度可定制的怪物升级系统，旨在解决冒险整合包中玩家强度与怪物强度之间微妙的平衡问题。</h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">怪物的等级基于实体特定初始等级、区域加成以及附近玩家的强度等因素分配。所有内容均可配置！<br>动态难度最初基于 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/auto-leveling\" rel=\"nofollow\">Daripher 的自动升级模组</a>，</h3>\n<h3>当前功能：</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>配置 <strong>每个等级修改哪些属性</strong> 及其数量</li>\n<li>基于<strong>距离</strong>/<strong>深度</strong>/<strong>高度</strong>的升级（通过配置文件，或通过数据包按维度配置）</li>\n<li><strong>实体类型</strong>（和<strong>实体标签</strong>）设置覆盖 - 覆盖基于维度的升级</li>\n<li><strong>基于结构</strong>（和<strong>结构标签</strong>）的等级加成，适用于结构内的所有实体</li>\n<li><strong>基于生物群系</strong>（和<strong>生物群系标签</strong>）的等级加成，适用于生物群系内的所有实体</li>\n<li><strong>基于玩家</strong>的等级加成（见下方的<strong>兼容性</strong>部分）</li>\n<li>战利品修饰符/条件，用于<strong>向特定怪物等级注入战利品</strong></li>\n<li>进入升级区域（维度、生物群系和结构）时显示<strong>区域名称</strong>和<strong>等级标题文本</strong></li>\n<li>稀有<strong>分层药水</strong>和<strong>水晶</strong>从升级怪物处掉落，用于<strong>升级你自己的宠物</strong>/其他怪物</li>\n<li>在实体名称旁边显示等级，颜色根据相对于玩家的估计难度进行着色</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>兼容性</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/puffish-skills\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pufferfish 的技能</a> -</strong> 技能点为怪物提供“基于玩家”的加成，带有树黑名单（默认 <code>\"puffish_skills:mining\"</code>）</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/reskillable-reimagined\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Reskillable Reimagined</a> -</strong> 技能点为怪物提供“基于玩家”的加成，带有技能黑名单（默认 <code>\"MINING\", \"FARMING\", \"GATHERING\", \"BUILDING\"</code>）</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/apotheosis\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">神化</a></strong> - <strong>世界层级</strong>显示在怪物等级/名称旁边</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dungeon-difficulty\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">地牢难度</a> </strong>- <strong>地牢层级</strong>显示在怪物等级/名称旁边</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jade\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">翡翠</a> </strong>- 在实体卡片中显示怪物等级</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-quest-types\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">更多任务类型</a> </strong>- 由更多任务类型开发者添加集成。请参阅他们的模组页面！</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/health-bars\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">生命条</a> </strong>- 等级追加到生命条名称中。内置于 26.1 版本。对于 1.21.1<strong>，请查看</strong><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/health-bars-dynamic-difficulty-compatibility\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此插件！</a></strong></li>\n<li>如果你安装了 <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/structure-credits\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">结构信用</a></strong>，结构标题会自动禁用</li>\n<li>如果你安装了 <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/travelers-titles\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">旅行者头衔</a></strong>，生物群系/维度标题会自动禁用</li>\n<li>为<strong>大量</strong>模组内置了升级设置：<br>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<div style=\"color:#7b88a1;background-color:#1e2127;font-family:Menlo, Monaco, &amp;#x27;font-weight:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:18px\">\n<div><span style=\"color:#eceff4\">-</span><span style=\"color:#7b88a1\"> 冒险地牢</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"color:#eceff4\">-</span><span style=\"color:#7b88a1\"> 天堂</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"color:#eceff4\">-</span><span style=\"color:#7b88a1\"> 远古试炼</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"color:#eceff4\">-</span><span style=\"color:#7b88a1\"> 水下奇迹</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"color:#eceff4\">-</span><span style=\"color:#7b88a1\"> ATi 结构</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"color:#eceff4\">-</span><span style=\"color:#7b88a1\"> YUNG 的更优沙漠神殿</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"color:#eceff4\">-</span><span style=\"color:#7b88a1\"> YUNG 的更优要塞</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"color:#eceff4\">-</span><span style=\"color:#7b88a1\"> YUNG 的更优丛林神庙</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"color:#eceff4\">-</span><span style=\"color:#7b88a1\"> YUNG 的更优海洋纪念碑</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"color:#eceff4\">-</span><span style=\"color:#7b88a1\"> YUNG 的更优要塞</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"color:#eceff4\">-</span><span style=\"color:#7b88a1\"> Bosses'Rise</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"color:#eceff4\">-</span><span style=\"color:#7b88a1\"> 血魔法</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"color:#eceff4\">-</span><span style=\"color:#7b88a1\"> 蓝天</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"color:#eceff4\">-</span><span style=\"color:#7b88a1\"> 大规模破坏者</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"color:#eceff4\">-</span><span style=\"color:#7b88a1\"> L_Ender 的灾难</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"color:#eceff4\">-</span><span style=\"color:#7b88a1\"> 灾难性伊利格</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"color:#eceff4\">-</span><span style=\"color:#7b88a1\"> 黑暗分身</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"color:#eceff4\">-</span><span style=\"color:#7b88a1\"> 更深更暗</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"color:#eceff4\">-</span><span style=\"color:#7b88a1\"> 地牢崛起</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"color:#eceff4\">-</span><span style=\"color:#7b88a1\"> 地牢崛起：七大洋</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"color:#eceff4\">-</span><span style=\"color:#7b88a1\"> 伊甸之环</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"color:#eceff4\">-</span><span style=\"color:#7b88a1\"> 艾迪伦</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"color:#eceff4\">-</span><span style=\"color:#7b88a1\"> 永恒星光</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"color:#eceff4\">-</span><span style=\"color:#7b88a1\"> 克利普索斯觉醒</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"color:#eceff4\">-</span><span style=\"color:#7b88a1\"> 朋友与敌人</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"color:#eceff4\">-</span><span style=\"color:#7b88a1\"> 霜满</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"color:#eceff4\">-</span><span style=\"color:#7b88a1\"> 守卫村民</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"color:#eceff4\">-</span><span style=\"color:#7b88a1\"> 冰与火：龙</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"color:#eceff4\">-</span><span style=\"color:#7b88a1\"> 伊利格入侵</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"color:#eceff4\">-</span><span style=\"color:#7b88a1\"> 铁与魔法</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"color:#eceff4\">-</span><span style=\"color:#7b88a1\"> Moog 的末地/旅行者/下界/翱翔结构</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"color:#eceff4\">-</span><span style=\"color:#7b88a1\"> 矿洞细胞</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"color:#eceff4\">-</span><span style=\"color:#7b88a1\"> 神话生物</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"color:#eceff4\">-</span><span style=\"color:#7b88a1\"> Mowzie 的生物</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"color:#eceff4\">-</span><span style=\"color:#7b88a1\"> Majrusz 的结构</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"color:#eceff4\">-</span><span style=\"color:#7b88a1\"> 地牢与酒馆</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"color:#eceff4\">-</span><span style=\"color:#7b88a1\"> 失乐园</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"color:#eceff4\">-</span><span style=\"color:#7b88a1\"> 复用结构</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"color:#eceff4\">-</span><span style=\"color:#7b88a1\"> RPG 小头目</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"color:#eceff4\">-</span><span style=\"color:#7b88a1\"> Marium 的魂系武器</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"color:#eceff4\">-</span><span style=\"color:#7b88a1\"> 需要洗劫</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"color:#eceff4\">-</span><span style=\"color:#7b88a1\"> 蜜蜂区</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"color:#eceff4\">-</span><span style=\"color:#7b88a1\"> T.O 魔法与额外内容</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"color:#eceff4\">-</span><span style=\"color:#7b88a1\"> 暮色森林</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"color:#eceff4\">-</span><span style=\"color:#7b88a1\"> 地下花园</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"color:#eceff4\">-</span><span style=\"color:#7b88a1\"> VoidZ</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>你可以在配置文件中禁用这些预设设置，或使用数据包修改它们/为其他模组添加自己的设置。</em></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#236fa1\">关于创建数据包的指南，请参阅 </span><a href=\"https://github.com/muon-rw/Dynamic-Difficulty?tab=readme-ov-file#datapack-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#236fa1\">GitHub 自述文件！</span></a></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong>模组开发者：动态难度提供了一个公共 API 用于创建集成 - 请参阅 <a href=\"https://github.com/muon-rw/Dynamic-Difficulty?tab=readme-ov-file#mod-developers-click-to-expand\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">开发环境设置</a>。如果你希望 API 中添加某些内容，请在 GitHub 或 Discord 上询问。</strong></span></p>\n<h3>即将推出：</h3>\n<ul>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>具有独特加成的分级护甲/武器等，将从分级怪物处掉落</strong></li>\n<li><strong>客户端侧难度选择</strong></li>\n</ul>\n</ul>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
